Requirements
We can now separate the assignment into:
Functional requirements
•	Register customers 
•	Authenticate customers 
•	Verify BVN/NIN 
•	Create accounts 
•	Check balances 
•	Transfer money 
•	Perform name enquiry 
•	Support intra-bank and inter-bank transfers 
•	Check transaction status 
•	View transaction history 
Business rules
•	KYC must succeed before account creation 
•	One account per customer 
•	Account starts with ₦15,000 
•	Sufficient funds required for transfers 
•	Ownership must be respected 
•	Customers can only see their own transaction history 
•	Name enquiry before transfer 
Security/non-functional requirements
•	Protect credentials and sensitive customer information 
•	Prevent unauthorized access 
We will refine this list against the exact assignment wording rather than treating this preliminary list as final.


